[00:36.54]Conversation One
[00:38.43]W: Hey, Mark. 
[00:39.98]I never noticed that belly of yours. 
[00:42.46]What have you been up to£¿
[00:44.18]M: I hang out with friends a lot lately. 
[00:46.67]I need to start working out again.
[00:49.16]W: That reminds me. 
[00:50.73]I should have hit the gym today.
[00:53.02]M: Where do you work out£¿
[00:55.10]W: At Bally's. It's pretty close to home so it is convenient.
[00:59.79]M: How much are you paying£¿
[01:01.54]W: I only pay 20 dollars a month after I become a member of it. 
[01:06.26]The membership costs me 200 dollars per year.
[01:10.06]M: That's pretty good. I think I should join too.
[01:13.81]W: If you join, we could work out together. 
[01:17.52]It's so much better working out with another person. It's hard to motivate yourself when you are alone.
[01:24.61]M: How about the facilities there£¿
[01:26.72]W: The inside facilities are the usual stuff but since it was opened last year, it even includes a health shop, a snack bar, a member lounge and two caf¨¦s.
[01:38.56]M: Sounds perfect! What do you usually do in the gym£¿
[01:42.74]W: I usually spend about 20 minutes on the treadmill, and then lift weights for about an hour.
[01:49.12]M: Do you go there every day£¿
[01:51.21]W: No. I try to go 4 times a week, but lately, I've been only going about two times a week. 
[01:58.54]That's why I need you to be there. 
[02:00.79]You should join.
[02:02.21]M: There are so many girls working out in a gym nowadays. 
[02:05.53]What do they usually do£¿
[02:07.23]W: Though some prefer rowing machines, stationary exercise bikes, and treadmills, the truth is that the most popular exercise for them is yoga.
[02:16.93]M: To be frank, I like yoga. 
[02:19.34]So I'm signing up tomorrow.
[02:21.53]W: So you're really going to join£¿
[02:23.69]M: Yeah. Let's go in tomorrow and I'll sign up. 
[02:27.51]We can work out together.
[02:30.73]Questions 1 to 4 are based on the conversation you have just heard.
[02:36.33]1. Why does the man get fat these days£¿
[02:54.60]2. Why does the woman want the man to join her gym£¿
